  "problem": "$3\\sqrt{x}-2\\sqrt{x}=$",
  "worked_solution": "We can combine the two $\\sqrt{x}$ terms together, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt{x}-2\\sqrt{x} & = \\\\ (3-2)\\sqrt{x} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{x} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
